        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7626,
        "name": "Fae",
        "desc": "<p>Followers of the first Cryo Archon, the Belyi Tsar, who were created from the bones of giant beasts and fallen frostmoon light.</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/04/07/237301566/8bfe123477466c3c8a09fbff5702b087_1528042153072418508.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Celaeno is an Augury Bird, one of the rarest types of the Fae. Augury Birds can see crossroads in the flow of their fate, immutable future events that all paths will lead to.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 10412,
        "name": "Linnea",
        "desc": "Naturalist and Advisor to the Nod-Krai Branch of the Adventurers' Guild.",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/04/03/b73622caa3750012312c72437295ace3_6973976776946504804.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Linnea is Celaeno's younger sister and a changeling. Her parents substituted her for a human child so that her Augury Bird's abilities would manifest as late as possible. Celaeno envied and hated her sister all her life, believing her to be living a happy and carefree life. In reality, Celaeno felt lonely without her sister.",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
